  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">UNDP  Gender Tomiris2</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNDP Gender Tomiris 2 - UNDP Gender</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Aktiviteten saknar beskrivning. Kontakta Sida f&#xf6;r mer information. Ring +46 8 698 50 00 eller skicka e-post till sida@sida.se.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sida has given support to gender promotion in Kazakhstan since 1997 with 15.7 MSEK, excluding the present project. In accordance with the cooperation strategy with Central Asia 2006-2009, the cooperation with Kazakhstan shall be phased out during the period. A phasing-out project will be carried out in 2007-2009 to establish three concepts on how to promote gender (3R method, gender lobbying, men and gender)</narrative>
  </description>
